# Browser language on the home page only (inner pages keep the language of
# their URL). First match wins. The nf_lang cookie, set by the language
# switcher, takes precedence over Accept-Language, so a choice is never
# overridden. Browsers have no Valencian code: Catalan goes to /va.
/  /va          302!  Language=ca
/  /index.html  200!  Language=es
/  /en          302!
